#: 01.md:1
msgid "Tutorial 1: Single-structure refinement with EMMIVox"
msgstr "チュートリアル1：EMMIVox による Single-structure Refinement"

#: 01.md:3
msgid ""
"These are the steps for refining a single structural model into a cryo-EM "
"maps with EMMIVox."
msgstr "cryo-EM Map と EMMIVox を使い、単一の構造モデルを Refinement する手順を示す。"

#: 01.md:5
msgid ""
"**Note**: all the python scripts are contained in the `scripts` folder. "
"Please run each step of the tutorial in the dedicated subfolder of "
"`tutorials/1-refinement` referred to as **Working directory**."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：Python スクリプトはすべて `scripts` フォルダにある。各手順は、`tutorials/1-refinement` "
"内の、**作業ディレクトリ**として指定したサブフォルダで実行する。"

#: 01.md:7
msgid "0. System setup"
msgstr "0. 系の設定"

#: 01.md:9
msgid ""
"Create the topology files and the initial conformation in GROMACS format "
"starting from the deposited PDB (`7P6A.pdb`). We have done this for you "
"using [CHARMM-GUI](https://www.charmm-gui.org). CHARMM-GUI can also complete"
" your system if there are missing residues and create the force field for a "
"small-molecule, if present."
msgstr ""
"登録済み PDB（`7P6A.pdb`）から、GROMACS 形式の Topology と初期 Conformation を作る。ここでは "
"[CHARMM-GUI](https://www.charmm-gui.org) で作成済みである。CHARMM-GUI は、欠損 Residues "
"の補完や、Small Molecule がある場合の Force Field の作成にも使える。"

#: 01.md:11
msgid ""
"**Note**: The conformation in the `step3_input.gro` file (GROMACS format) "
"produced by CHARMM-GUI is identical to one in the deposited PDB. However, "
"CHARMM-GUI will probably translate and rotate your initial PDB, which will "
"then not fit the input cryo-EM map anymore. Furthermore, atoms order might "
"be different."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：CHARMM-GUI が出力した GROMACS 形式の `step3_input.gro` の Conformation は、登録 "
"PDB と同じである。ただし、初期 PDB に並進・回転を加えることが多く、そのままでは入力 cryo-EM Map "
"に合わなくなる。原子の順序も変わる場合がある。"

#: 01.md:14
msgid ""
"CHARMM-GUI renumbers residues and chains in `step3_input.gro`, so we first "
"need to make sure we have a PDB file consistent with the `gro` atom order. "
"We can create this PDB file using this command:"
msgstr ""
"CHARMM-GUI は `step3_input.gro` の Residues と Chains の番号を振り直すため、まず `gro` "
"の原子順序に対応した PDB を用意する。次のコマンドで作成できる。"

#: 01.md:17
msgid "`bash renumber.sh step3_input.gro step3_input.pdb`"
msgstr "`bash renumber.sh step3_input.gro step3_input.pdb`"

#: 01.md:19
msgid ""
"Add to the index file created by CHARMM-GUI (`index.ndx`) two custom groups:"
msgstr "CHARMM-GUI の Index ファイル（`index.ndx`）に、2つの Groups を追加する。"

#: 01.md:21
msgid ""
"`System-MAP`, which contains all the atoms that will be used to generate the"
" cryo-EM map. You can do this with `make_ndx.py` in `scripts` using "
"[`MDAnalysis`](https://www.mdanalysis.org) selection syntax. Hydrogen atoms "
"and the carboxylate oxygens of glutamic/aspartic acid will be automatically "
"removed from this group, as they are not used in PLUMED to calculate the "
"cryo-EM map. A second group, called `System-MAP-H` will also be created to "
"include these missing atoms (mostly to write them in the trajectory file)."
msgstr ""
"`System-MAP` は、cryo-EM Map の生成に使うすべての原子を含む。`scripts` の `make_ndx.py` "
"で、[`MDAnalysis`](https://www.mdanalysis.org) の Selection Syntax "
"を用いて作れる。水素原子と Glutamic／Aspartic Acid の Carboxylate Oxygens は、PLUMED の Map "
"計算には使わないため、自動的に除外される。これらを含めた `System-MAP-H` も作成され、主に Trajectory 出力に用いる。"

#: 01.md:23
msgid ""
"`python make_ndx.py step3_input.gro \"protein\" System-MAP --ndx index.ndx`"
msgstr ""
"`python make_ndx.py step3_input.gro \"protein\" System-MAP --ndx index.ndx`"

#: 01.md:25
msgid ""
"`System-XTC`, which contains all the atoms that will be written to the "
"GROMACS trajectory file (xtc format). In this case, we want to write all the"
" atoms used for the cryo-EM calculation plus hydrogen and carboxylate "
"oxygens of glutamic/aspartic acid."
msgstr ""
"`System-XTC` は、GROMACS の xtc 形式の Trajectory に出力する原子を含む。ここでは、cryo-EM "
"計算に使う原子に加えて、水素と Glutamic／Aspartic Acid の Carboxylate Oxygens も出力する。"

#: 01.md:27
msgid "`python make_XTC_ndx.py System-MAP-H --ndx index.ndx`"
msgstr "`python make_XTC_ndx.py System-MAP-H --ndx index.ndx`"

#: 01.md:29
msgid "**Working directory**: `0-Building`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`0-Building`"

#: 01.md:31
msgid "1. Map preparation"
msgstr "1. Map の準備"

#: 01.md:33
msgid ""
"At this stage we need to download the cryo-EM full map "
"[`emd_13223.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/map/emd_13223.map.gz)."
" the two half-maps "
"[`emd_13223_half_map_1.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/other/emd_13223_half_map_1.map.gz)"
" and "
"[`emd_13223_half_map_2.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/other/emd_13223_half_map_2.map.gz),"
" and the PDB [`7P6A.pdb`](https://files.rcsb.org/download/7P6A.pdb), which "
"will be needed to zone the density map close to the model (optional, but "
"speeds up things a lot)."
msgstr ""
"cryo-EM の Full Map "
"[`emd_13223.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/map/emd_13223.map.gz)、2つの"
" Half-maps "
"[`emd_13223_half_map_1.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/other/emd_13223_half_map_1.map.gz)"
" と "
"[`emd_13223_half_map_2.map`](https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/emdb/structures/EMD-13223/other/emd_13223_half_map_2.map.gz)、および"
" PDB [`7P6A.pdb`](https://files.rcsb.org/download/7P6A.pdb) をダウンロードする。PDB "
"は、密度 Map をモデルの近傍に限定するために使う。これは任意だが、大きく高速化できる。"

#: 01.md:38
msgid ""
"To convert the input cryo-EM map to PLUMED format, calculate an error map "
"from the two half maps, and optionally filter voxels by correlation, you "
"need to execute this:"
msgstr ""
"入力 Map を PLUMED 形式に変換し、2つの Half-maps から Error Map を計算し、必要なら相関で Voxels "
"を絞るには、次を実行する。"

#: 01.md:40
msgid ""
"`python cryo-EM_preprocess.py emd_13223.map 0.9 emd_plumed.dat --zone 3.5 "
"--zone_PDB 7P6A.pdb --zone_sel \"protein\" --halfmaps "
"emd_13223_half_map_1.map emd_13223_half_map_2.map > log.preprocess`"
msgstr ""
"`python cryo-EM_preprocess.py emd_13223.map 0.9 emd_plumed.dat --zone 3.5 "
"--zone_PDB 7P6A.pdb --zone_sel \"protein\" --halfmaps "
"emd_13223_half_map_1.map emd_13223_half_map_2.map > log.preprocess`"

#: 01.md:42
msgid ""
"**Note 1**: The value `0.9` is the cutoff to exclude correlated voxels "
"(above this threshold). If you want to keep all the voxels of the input map,"
" set this to `1.0`. `emd_plumed.dat` is the name of the output map in PLUMED"
" format. `--zone` can be used to keep only voxels within a certain distance "
"(here 3.5 Ang) from the model specified by `--zone_PDB`."
msgstr ""
"**注意1**：`0.9` は、相関がこれを超える Voxels を除外する Cutoff である。すべて残したければ `1.0` "
"にする。`emd_plumed.dat` は PLUMED 形式の出力 Map 名である。`--zone` で、`--zone_PDB` "
"のモデルから指定距離、ここでは3.5 Ang 以内の Voxels だけを残せる。"

#: 01.md:44
msgid ""
"**Note 2**: If you want to give a look at the map after the preparation, you"
" can inspect `emd_plumed.mrc`. This is the map that will be used in PLUMED "
"for modelling and corresponds to `emd_plumed.dat`."
msgstr ""
"**注意2**：準備後の Map を確認するには `emd_plumed.mrc` を見る。これが PLUMED の Modelling "
"に使われ、`emd_plumed.dat` に対応する Map である。"

#: 01.md:46
msgid ""
"Now we align the cryo-EM map in PLUMED format (`emd_plumed.dat`) to the "
"GROMACS conformation (`step3_input.pdb`). This is needed because CHARMM-GUI "
"probably moved the initial structure during system setup."
msgstr ""
"次に、PLUMED 形式の Map（`emd_plumed.dat`）を GROMACS の "
"Conformation（`step3_input.pdb`）に合わせる。CHARMM-GUI が系の設定中に初期構造を移動した可能性があるためである。"

#: 01.md:48
msgid ""
"`python align-VOXELS.py ../0-Building/step3_input.pdb 7P6A.pdb "
"emd_plumed_aligned.dat emd_plumed.dat --ref_sel \"backbone\" --mobile_sel "
"\"backbone and not altLoc B and not (name O and resid 379)\"`"
msgstr ""
"`python align-VOXELS.py ../0-Building/step3_input.pdb 7P6A.pdb "
"emd_plumed_aligned.dat emd_plumed.dat --ref_sel \"backbone\" --mobile_sel "
"\"backbone and not altLoc B and not (name O and resid 379)\"`"

#: 01.md:50
msgid ""
"**Note 3**: Since there are some discrepancies between the number of atoms "
"in the two PDBs, we have specified a selection of common atoms for alignment"
" using [`MDAnalysis`](https://www.mdanalysis.org) selection syntax. "
"`--ref_sel` refers to `step3_input.pdb` and `--mobile_sel` to `7P6A.pdb`. "
"You can verify that the alignment is correct by checking the RMSD value in "
"output: it should be zero as the two models are identical."
msgstr ""
"**注意3**：2つの PDB の原子数が異なるため、[`MDAnalysis`](https://www.mdanalysis.org) の "
"Selection Syntax で共通の原子を選んで Alignment する。`--ref_sel` は "
"`step3_input.pdb`、`--mobile_sel` は `7P6A.pdb` を指す。出力の RMSD "
"で確認でき、同じモデルなので0となるはずである。"

#: 01.md:52
msgid "**Working directory**: `1-Map-Preparation`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`1-Map-Preparation`"

#: 01.md:54
msgid "2. System equilibration"
msgstr "2. 系の Equilibration"

#: 01.md:56
msgid ""
"We need to prepare the system with an energy minimization and equilibration "
"at room temperature. No cryo-EM restraints will be used at this stage."
msgstr ""
"Energy Minimization と室温での Equilibration を行う。この段階では cryo-EM Restraints は加えない。"

#: 01.md:58
msgid "Run energy minimization:"
msgstr "Energy Minimization を実行する。"

#: 01.md:60
msgid ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 0-em-steep.mdp -c ../0-Building/step3_input.gro -p "
"../0-Building/topol.top -o em.tpr`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 0-em-steep.mdp -c ../0-Building/step3_input.gro -p "
"../0-Building/topol.top -o em.tpr`"

#: 01.md:62
msgid "`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm em`"
msgstr "`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm em`"

#: 01.md:64
msgid ""
"Do a 1-ns NPT equilibration with positional restraints on everything except "
"water and ions:"
msgstr "水と Ions 以外に Position Restraints を加え、1 ns の NPT Equilibration を行う。"

#: 01.md:66
msgid ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 1_npt_posres.mdp -c em.gro -n ../0-Building/index.ndx -p "
"../0-Building/topol.top -r em.gro -o npt_posres.tpr -maxwarn 1`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 1_npt_posres.mdp -c em.gro -n ../0-Building/index.ndx -p "
"../0-Building/topol.top -r em.gro -o npt_posres.tpr -maxwarn 1`"

#: 01.md:68
msgid "`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm npt_posres -nsteps 500000 -update gpu`"
msgstr "`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm npt_posres -nsteps 500000 -update gpu`"

#: 01.md:70
msgid ""
"Do a 2-ns NVT equilibration with positional restraints on everything except "
"water and ions:"
msgstr "水と Ions 以外に Position Restraints を加え、2 ns の NVT Equilibration を行う。"

#: 01.md:72
msgid ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 2_nvt_posres.mdp -c npt_posres.gro -n "
"../0-Building/index.ndx -p ../0-Building/topol.top -r em.gro -o "
"nvt_posres.tpr -maxwarn 1`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 2_nvt_posres.mdp -c npt_posres.gro -n "
"../0-Building/index.ndx -p ../0-Building/topol.top -r em.gro -o "
"nvt_posres.tpr -maxwarn 1`"

#: 01.md:74
msgid "`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm nvt_posres -nsteps 1000000 -update gpu`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm nvt_posres -nsteps 1000000 -update gpu`"

#: 01.md:76
msgid "**Working directory**: `2-Equilibration`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`2-Equilibration`"

#: 01.md:78
msgid "3. Optimizing the cryo-EM map scaling factor"
msgstr "3. cryo-EM Map の Scaling Factor の最適化"

#: 01.md:80
msgid ""
"We postprocess the NVT equilibration trajectory to obtain an optimal scaling"
" factor between experimental and predicted map."
msgstr ""
"NVT Equilibration の Trajectory を後処理し、実験と予測の Maps の間の最適な Scaling Factor を求める。"

#: 01.md:82
msgid "`bash optimize_scale.sh 8`"
msgstr "`bash optimize_scale.sh 8`"

#: 01.md:84
msgid ""
"Here we are using 8 CPU cores (and the GPU) to postprocess the trajectory "
"with PLUMED. The optimal value of the scale will be printed in `BEST_SCALE` "
"at the end of the optimization. This will be used for both single-structure "
"refinement and ensemble modelling."
msgstr ""
"ここでは8つの CPU Cores と GPU を用いて、PLUMED で後処理する。最適化後の値は `BEST_SCALE` "
"に出力され、Single-structure Refinement と Ensemble Modelling の両方に使う。"

#: 01.md:86
msgid "**Working directory**: `3-Map-Scaling`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`3-Map-Scaling`"

#: 01.md:88
msgid "4. Production"
msgstr "4. 本計算"

#: 01.md:90
msgid ""
"To run the production simulation for single-structure refinement we need to:"
msgstr "Single-structure Refinement の本計算には、次の準備が必要である。"

#: 01.md:92
msgid "Prepare the `plumed_EMMI.dat` file with production parameters using:"
msgstr "次のコマンドで、本計算のパラメータを使う `plumed_EMMI.dat` を作る。"

#: 01.md:94
msgid "`bash prepare_PLUMED_input.sh`"
msgstr "`bash prepare_PLUMED_input.sh`"

#: 01.md:96
msgid ""
"The generated PLUMED input file, called `plumed_EMMI.dat`, should look like "
"this:"
msgstr "生成される PLUMED 入力 `plumed_EMMI.dat` は、次のようになる。"

#: 01.md:137
msgid ""
"Run a 10-ns long production run following the instructions below, after "
"setting the number of CPU cores to use (`$OMP_NUM_THREADS`)."
msgstr "CPU Core 数（`$OMP_NUM_THREADS`）を設定し、次の手順で10 ns の本計算を行う。"

#: 01.md:139
msgid ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 4-nvt-production.mdp -c ../2-Equilibration/nvt_posres.gro"
" -n ../0-Building/index.ndx -p ../0-Building/topol.top -o production.tpr`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi grompp -f 4-nvt-production.mdp -c ../2-Equilibration/nvt_posres.gro"
" -n ../0-Building/index.ndx -p ../0-Building/topol.top -o production.tpr`"

#: 01.md:141
msgid ""
"`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm production -ntomp $OMP_NUM_THREADS -nsteps "
"5000000 -plumed plumed_EMMI.dat`"
msgstr ""
"`gmx_mpi mdrun -pin on -deffnm production -ntomp $OMP_NUM_THREADS -nsteps "
"5000000 -plumed plumed_EMMI.dat`"

#: 01.md:143
msgid ""
"**Note**: Do **not** add the option `-update gpu` when using GROMACS in "
"combination with PLUMED."
msgstr "**注意**：GROMACS と PLUMED を組み合わせる場合、`-update gpu` を追加しては**いけない**。"

#: 01.md:145
msgid "**Working directory**: `4-Production`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`4-Production`"

#: 01.md:147
msgid "5. Postprocessing and validation"
msgstr "5. 後処理と検証"

#: 01.md:149
msgid ""
"We first need to extract the conformation with best EMMIVox score from our "
"production run and perform a short energy minimization. To setup all the "
"files needed for minimization, you need to execute this script:"
msgstr ""
"まず、本計算から EMMIVox Score が最良の Conformation を取り出し、短い Energy Minimization "
"を行う。必要なファイルは、次のスクリプトで用意する。"

#: 01.md:151
msgid "`bash prepare_PLUMED_input_emin.sh`"
msgstr "`bash prepare_PLUMED_input_emin.sh`"

#: 01.md:153
msgid "Now we run energy minimization using 8 CPU cores:"
msgstr "次に、8つの CPU Cores で Energy Minimization を実行する。"

#: 01.md:155
msgid "`bash run_PLUMED_emin.sh 8`"
msgstr "`bash run_PLUMED_emin.sh 8`"

#: 01.md:157
msgid ""
"After minimization is complete, we need to align `conf_pbc.pdb` to the "
"original cryo-EM map using the `transformation.dat` file created during the "
"map preparation stage:"
msgstr ""
"完了したら、Map の準備で作った `transformation.dat` を使い、`conf_pbc.pdb` を元の cryo-EM Map "
"に合わせる。"

#: 01.md:160
msgid ""
"`python align-PDBs.py conf_pbc.pdb conf_pbc_aligned.pdb ../1-Map-"
"Preparation/transformation.dat`"
msgstr ""
"`python align-PDBs.py conf_pbc.pdb conf_pbc_aligned.pdb ../1-Map-"
"Preparation/transformation.dat`"

#: 01.md:162
msgid "Finally, we add the BFactors column to our aligned model:"
msgstr "最後に、Alignment したモデルに BFactors の列を追加する。"

#: 01.md:164
msgid "`python add-BFACT.py conf_pbc_aligned.pdb EMMIStatus conf_EMMIVOX.pdb`"
msgstr ""
"`python add-BFACT.py conf_pbc_aligned.pdb EMMIStatus conf_EMMIVOX.pdb`"

#: 01.md:166
msgid ""
"The output PDB file `conf_EMMIVOX.pdb` is ready to be validated with PHENIX:"
msgstr "出力 PDB `conf_EMMIVOX.pdb` は、PHENIX で検証できる状態になっている。"

#: 01.md:168
msgid ""
"`bash do_PHENIX conf_EMMIVOX.pdb ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map 1.9 > "
"results.EMMIVOX`"
msgstr ""
"`bash do_PHENIX conf_EMMIVOX.pdb ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map 1.9 > "
"results.EMMIVOX`"

#: 01.md:170
msgid ""
"where `1.9` is the resolution of the input map `emd_13223.map` in Angstrom. "
"Validation metrics are saved in `results.EMMIVOX`."
msgstr ""
"`1.9` は入力 Map `emd_13223.map` の Angstrom 単位の Resolution である。検証指標は "
"`results.EMMIVOX` に保存される。"

#: 01.md:172
msgid "Compare the EMMIVOX-refined model with the deposited PDB:"
msgstr "EMMIVOX で Refinement したモデルを、登録済み PDB と比較する。"

#: 01.md:174
msgid ""
"`bash do_PHENIX ../1-Map-Preparation/7P6A.pdb ../1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map 1.9 > results.PDB`"
msgstr ""
"`bash do_PHENIX ../1-Map-Preparation/7P6A.pdb ../1-Map-"
"Preparation/emd_13223.map 1.9 > results.PDB`"

#: 01.md:176
msgid ""
"Model fit to the data (CC_mask) can be calculated using our internal script:"
msgstr "データへのモデルの適合度（CC_mask）は、付属のスクリプトでも計算できる。"

#: 01.md:178
msgid ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --threshold=0.0 > CCmask.EMMIVOX`"
msgstr ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=conf_EMMIVOX.pdb --threshold=0.0 > CCmask.EMMIVOX`"

#: 01.md:180
msgid ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=../1-Map-Preparation/7P6A.pdb --threshold=0.0 > CCmask.PDB`"
msgstr ""
"`python cryo-EM_validate.py ../1-Map-Preparation/emd_13223.map "
"--pdbA=../1-Map-Preparation/7P6A.pdb --threshold=0.0 > CCmask.PDB`"

#: 01.md:182
msgid "**Working directory**: `5-Analysis`"
msgstr "**作業ディレクトリ**：`5-Analysis`"

#: 01.md:184
msgid "[Back to EMMIVox home](NAVIGATION.md)"
msgstr "[EMMIVox のホームに戻る](NAVIGATION.md)"
